  "notes": [
    "This is a frozen catastrophe/direction pilot after only two MGDA iterations. Failure of preservation or broad strongly negative movement rejects this dose/implementation; a noisy near-zero panel does not reject long-horizon online MGDA and should instead inform a geometric training replication.",
    "Standard10 preservation passed on 20,000 balanced outcome-blind states: mean TV 0.011560 and greedy disagreement 0.0121, with exact checkpoint metadata/tensor-scope gates.",
    "Frozen 32,768-hand panel completed: pooled MGDA-minus-control -5.8441 bb/100 with CI95 half-width 4.6987 (upper -1.1454); 0/4 anchors and both seats negative. Independent raw audit is scheduled before decision, followed by output-step localization.",
    "Independent raw audit passed all 14 gates: 8,192 unique complete pairs, full 52-card permutations, exact pair indices, row arithmetic, summary recomputation, raw/checkpoint/drift hashes, and both seats. Pooled delta -5.8441 +/-4.6987 bb/100 has upper CI -1.1454; all four anchors and both seats are negative.",
    "Realized-step audit found control-parent actor L2 0.012424, treatment-parent 0.015560 (ratio 1.25248), treatment-control cosine 0.54392, mean output TV 0.006964 and greedy disagreement 0.725%. Gradient norm matching therefore did not match the realized stateful-Adam parameter step."
  ],
  "result": {
    "summary": "The frozen two-update online-MGDA treatment preserved Standard10 capability but lost significantly to matched ordinary control over 32,768 untouched multi-anchor hands: -5.8441 bb/100 with CI95 [-10.5428,-1.1454], 0/4 anchors and both seats negative. Raw evidence passed independent audit. Stateful Adam amplified the treatment parameter step to 1.2525x control despite per-minibatch gradient-norm matching.",
    "conclusion": "This is explicit short-horizon causal evidence against the current alpha=1 unit-normalized online-MGDA dose/optimizer realization, not merely failure to beat Slumbot at small scale. Local PPO/KL common descent did not translate to greedy payoff, and existing Adam moments broke the intended dose match. Do not scale this implementation. The general long-horizon learned-policy family remains open because ordinary 262k-to-1M evidence was weakly positive and source capability stayed intact.",
    "decision": "REJECT_UNIT_NORMALIZED_ONLINE_MGDA_DOSE",
    "next_step": "Localize an optimizer-aware realized-step dose boundary before any more environment training: construct frozen actor interpolations from control toward MGDA treatment at geometric fractions and measure greedy-boundary/output drift plus paired payoff on bounded common decks. If all nonzero doses remain directionally negative, close this direction; if a low dose avoids reversal, implement explicit parameter-step trust region and replicate before scaling."
  },
